{"id":"721ab3634175d59a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/109_IΔ₀.md","title":"109 IΔ₀","display":"109_IΔ₀","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})=\n\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})=\n\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to\\mathsf{Var}\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\\to\\mathsf{Var},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_{\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var})\\to\\mathsf{Var},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{fresh}(X)=v_{\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>函数符号为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0:0,\\qquad S:1,\\qquad +:2,\\qquad \\times:2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0:0,\\qquad S:1,\\qquad +:2,\\qquad \\times:2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>唯一非逻辑关系符号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>，元数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span>。逻辑构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\doteq,\\quad\\neg,\\quad\\to,\\quad\\forall.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\doteq,\\quad\\neg,\\quad\\to,\\quad\\forall.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\Delta_0\">\\(I\\Delta_0\\)</span> 的目标差异是：语言没有指数函数或指数关系，归纳只对由有界量词生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 公式开放。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项、公式与-$\\Delta_0$\">2. 项、公式与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span></h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{var}(x)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(\\operatorname{zero}\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{succ}(t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{succ}(t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{add}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{add}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{mul}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{mul}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{eq}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lt}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lt}(s,t)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{all}(x,A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists,\\land,\\lor,\\leftrightarrow\">\\(\\exists,\\land,\\lor,\\leftrightarrow\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\to,\\forall\">\\(\\neg,\\to,\\forall\\)</span> 的显示缩写。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x&lt;t\\,A:=\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\exists x&lt;t\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\neg A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x&lt;t\\,A:=\\forall x(x&lt;t\\to A),\n\\qquad\n\\exists x&lt;t\\,A:=\\neg\\forall x&lt;t\\,\\neg A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 是满足下列闭包条件的最小子集：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\doteq t\">\\(s\\doteq t\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s&lt;t\">\\(s&lt;t\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A,B\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x&lt;t\\,A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(\\forall x&lt;t\\,A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x&lt;t\\,A\\in\\Delta_0\">\\(\\exists x&lt;t\\,A\\in\\Delta_0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>有界量词的自由变量由其展开式给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall x&lt;t\\,A)\n=\n(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t))\\setminus\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall x&lt;t\\,A)\n=\n(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t))\\setminus\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\exists x&lt;t\\,A)\n=\n(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t))\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\exists x&lt;t\\,A)\n=\n(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t))\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\Delta_0\\land x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\land s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\n\\Rightarrow A[x:=s]\\in\\Delta_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\Delta_0\\land x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\land s\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\n\\Rightarrow A[x:=s]\\in\\Delta_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^{\\Delta_0}:\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_T^{\\Delta_0}:\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\to\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^{\\Delta_0}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_F^{\\Delta_0}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\times\\mathsf{Var}\\times\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[x:=s]\">\\(t[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^{\\Delta_0}(t,x,s)\">\\(Sub_T^{\\Delta_0}(t,x,s)\\)</span>，记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=s]\">\\(A[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^{\\Delta_0}(A,x,s)\">\\(Sub_F^{\\Delta_0}(A,x,s)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}:\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}:\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(S(t))=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(S(t))=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s+t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s\\times t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s+t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s\\times t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(s&lt;t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(s&lt;t)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall xA)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall xA)=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Var})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(s&lt;t)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(s\\doteq t)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(s&lt;t)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A\\to B)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall xA)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(\\forall xA)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项替换为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=s]=0,\\quad S(t)[x:=s]=S(t[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=s]=0,\\quad S(t)[x:=s]=S(t[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u+v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]+v[x:=s],\\qquad\n(u\\times v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]\\times v[x:=s].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u+v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]+v[x:=s],\\qquad\n(u\\times v)[x:=s]=u[x:=s]\\times v[x:=s].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u\\doteq v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\doteq v[x:=s]),\\quad\n(u&lt;v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]&lt;v[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u\\doteq v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]\\doteq v[x:=s]),\\quad\n(u&lt;v)[x:=s]=(u[x:=s]&lt;v[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\\quad\n(A\\to B)[x:=s]=(A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\neg A)[x:=s]=\\neg(A[x:=s]),\\quad\n(A\\to B)[x:=s]=(A[x:=s]\\to B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\forall yA\">\\(C=\\forall yA\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=z])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s),\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\nC,&amp;y=x,\\\\\n\\forall y(A[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s),\\\\\n\\forall z((A[y:=z])[x:=s]),&amp;y\\ne x,\\ y\\in\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s),\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}(\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf T}(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\})\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\Delta_0}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\Delta_0}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span> 上的等价关系；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\neg A,\\neg B)\\in E\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\Rightarrow(A_0\\to A_1,B_0\\to B_1)\\in E\">\\((A_0,B_0),(A_1,B_1)\\in E\\Rightarrow(A_0\\to A_1,B_0\\to B_1)\\in E\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\">\\((A,B)\\in E\\Rightarrow(\\forall xA,\\forall xB)\\in E\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>，则</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\forall xA,\\forall y(A[x:=y]))\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\forall xA,\\forall y(A[x:=y]))\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"4.-逻辑公理\">4. 逻辑公理</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\\)</span> 为下列七个集合的并；它们依次记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to2},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to3},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall2},\\mathsf{Ax}_{=1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{=2}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to2},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to3},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall2},\\mathsf{Ax}_{=1},\\mathsf{Ax}_{=2}\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t]:x\\in\\mathsf{Var},t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0},\nx\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0},\nx\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{t\\doteq t:t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{(s\\doteq t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{(s\\doteq t)\\to(A[x:=s]\\to A[x:=t]):\nx\\in\\mathsf{Var},s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_{\\Delta_0},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall2}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to2}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to3}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\forall2}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=1}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"5.-基本算术公理与-$\\Delta_0$-归纳\">5. 基本算术公理与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 归纳</h1>\n<p>基本算术公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{S0}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{S\\operatorname{inj}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{+0}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{+S}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\times0}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\times S}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{&lt;0}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{&lt;S}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{S0}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{S\\operatorname{inj}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{+0}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{+S}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\times0}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\times S}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{&lt;0}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{&lt;S}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{S0}=\\{\\neg S(x)\\doteq0:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{S0}=\\{\\neg S(x)\\doteq0:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{S\\operatorname{inj}}=\\{S(x)\\doteq S(y)\\to x\\doteq y:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{S\\operatorname{inj}}=\\{S(x)\\doteq S(y)\\to x\\doteq y:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{+0}=\\{x+0\\doteq x:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{+0}=\\{x+0\\doteq x:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{+S}=\\{x+S(y)\\doteq S(x+y):x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{+S}=\\{x+S(y)\\doteq S(x+y):x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\times0}=\\{x\\times0\\doteq0:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\times0}=\\{x\\times0\\doteq0:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\times S}=\\{x\\times S(y)\\doteq(x\\times y)+x:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\times S}=\\{x\\times S(y)\\doteq(x\\times y)+x:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{&lt;0}=\\{\\neg x&lt;0:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{&lt;0}=\\{\\neg x&lt;0:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{&lt;S}=\\{x&lt;S(y)\\leftrightarrow(x&lt;y\\lor x\\doteq y):x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{&lt;S}=\\{x&lt;S(y)\\leftrightarrow(x&lt;y\\lor x\\doteq y):x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> 归纳公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Ind}}=\n\\{A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=S(x)]))\\to\\forall xA):\nA\\in\\Delta_0,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Ind}}=\n\\{A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=S(x)]))\\to\\forall xA):\nA\\in\\Delta_0,x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{I\\Delta_0}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Ind}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{I\\Delta_0}=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Logic}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\Delta_0\\operatorname{-Ind}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"6.-推理规则\">6. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>规则显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{\\forall xA},\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{B}\\ (A\\equiv_\\alpha B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\to}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\forall}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):x\\in\\mathsf{Var},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0},A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\alpha}=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0},A\\equiv_\\alpha B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><hr>\n<h1 id=\"7.-证明对象\">7. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\Delta_0}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{I\\Delta_0}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{I\\Delta_0}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\(\\pi=(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span> 是非空有限公式序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{m-1}=A\">\\(A_{m-1}=A\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\">\\(A_i\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{I\\Delta_0}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{I\\Delta_0}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\forall xA_j\">\\(A_i=\\forall xA_j\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(C)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{C\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{\\mathsf F}(C)\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j\\equiv_\\alpha A_i\">\\(A_j\\equiv_\\alpha A_i\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h1 id=\"8.-可证性\">8. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{I\\Delta_0}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\operatorname{Proof}_{I\\Delta_0}(\\Gamma,\\pi,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\